&lt;div class=&quot;BDsoustitre&quot;&gt;Attaque&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;VD&lt;/b&gt; 9 m (6 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;), escalade 9 m
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; langue, +4 (1d4+3 plus maladie et &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Distraction-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Distraction&quot;&gt;distraction&lt;/a&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Attaques sp&#233;ciales&lt;/b&gt; distraction (DD 13)
